    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0112",
      "reading_order": 142,
      "section": "Section 2: Routine Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.0,
        "t": 585.8025,
        "r": 534.563625,
        "b": 545.4375
      },
      "content": "WARNING: Do not spray or pour any liquid on the monitor or its accessories. Do not  immerse  the  N5500  or  its  accessories  in  liquid  or  clean  with  caustic  or abrasive cleaners.",
      "severity": "warning"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0113",
      "reading_order": 143,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 531.6165,
        "r": 152.813175,
        "b": 514.6875
      },
      "content": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0114",
      "reading_order": 144,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 149.25,
        "t": 501.00375,
        "r": 538.8120749999999,
        "b": 474.74625
      },
      "content": "To clean the N5500, dampen a cloth with a commercial, nonabrasive cleaner and wipe the exterior surfaces lightly."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0028",
      "reading_order": 145,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.45974731445312,
        "t": 461.67535400390625,
        "r": 127.51821899414062,
        "b": 441.58837890625
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0028.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0114",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0115",
      "width": 20,
      "height": 20,
      "image_hash": "63462d69d7f08d580611ad2673caf1aef7de916d06717aa4bd4e8e9e06fb38fe"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0115",
      "reading_order": 146,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 150.75,
        "t": 461.3025,
        "r": 538.5650624999996,
        "b": 434.4375
      },
      "content": "CAUTION: Do not allow any liquids to come  in contact with the power connector or switches or to penetrate connectors or openings in the instrument.",
      "severity": "caution"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0116",
      "reading_order": 147,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 150.751125,
        "t": 420.00375,
        "r": 539.0649000000003,
        "b": 393.74625
      },
      "content": "Note: For cables, sensors and cuffs, follow the cleaning instructions in the directions for use that accompany these accessories.",
      "severity": "note"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0117",
      "reading_order": 148,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 150.75112499999994,
        "t": 393.00375,
        "r": 494.06399999999996,
        "b": 380.24625
      },
      "content": "Note: If liquid is spilled on the monitor, clean and dry thoroughly before reuse.",
      "severity": "note"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0118",
      "reading_order": 149,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 150.75112499999994,
        "t": 379.50375,
        "r": 514.3139999999999,
        "b": 366.74625
      },
      "content": "Note: If in doubt about monitor safety, refer the unit to qualified service personnel.",
      "severity": "note"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0119",
      "reading_order": 150,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 150.75112499999994,
        "t": 352.50375,
        "r": 419.06249999999994,
        "b": 339.74625
      },
      "content": "For surface-cleaning, follow your institution's procedures or:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0120",
      "reading_order": 151,
      "section": "2.1 Cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 170.99999999999994,
        "t": 325.50375,
        "r": 538.442549999999,
        "b": 272.2462499999999
      },
      "content": "l The  N5500  may  be  surface-cleaned  by  using  a  soft  cloth  dampened  with either  a  commercial,  nonabrasive  cleaner  or  a  solution  of  70%  alcohol  in water,  and  lightly  wiping  the  top,  bottom,  and  front  surfaces  of  the  monitor lightly."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0121",
      "reading_order": 152,
      "section": "2.2 Periodic Safety and Functional Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 261.6165,
        "r": 335.8131,
        "b": 244.6875
      },
      "content": "2.2 Periodic Safety and Functional Checks",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0122",
      "reading_order": 153,
      "section": "2.2 Periodic Safety and Functional Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 148.49887499999994,
        "t": 231.00374999999997,
        "r": 537.9378749999998,
        "b": 191.24625000000003
      },
      "content": "The  N5500  requires  no  routine  service  or  calibration  other  than  cleaning  and battery maintenance.  The  following  performance  verification  tests  may  be  used  following repair or during routine maintenance (if required by your local  institution)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0123",
      "reading_order": 154,
      "section": "2.2 Periodic Safety and Functional Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.74962499999998,
        "t": 177.00374999999997,
        "r": 363.56174999999996,
        "b": 164.24625000000003
      },
      "content": "Inspect the exterior of the N5500 for damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0124",
      "reading_order": 155,
      "section": "2.2 Periodic Safety and Functional Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.74962499999995,
        "t": 150.00374999999997,
        "r": 538.3141874999999,
        "b": 123.74625000000003
      },
      "content": "Inspect  labels  for  legibility.  If  the  labels  are  not  legible,  contact  Nellcor Technical Services Department or your local Nellcor representative."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0125",
      "reading_order": 156,
      "section": "2.2 Periodic Safety and Functional Checks",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 147.74962499999998,
        "t": 110.30250000000001,
        "r": 537.1021124999999,
        "b": 83.24625000000003
      },
      "content": "Verify  that  the  unit  performs  properly  as  described  in Performance  Verification section."
    }
  ],
